      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 🎙️ Kokoro TTS V1.0 - Complete Suite\n",
        "\n",
        "[Kokoro-82M v1.0](https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M) | [GitHub](https://github.com/Fujitoo/Kokoro-TTS-Subtitle)\n",
        "\n",
        "**Features:**\n",
        "- 📝 **Multilingual TTS** - 9 languages, multiple voices\n",
        "- 🎭 **Multi-Speaker Studio** (NEW!) - Create dialogues with multiple speakers\n",
        "- 🎬 **SRT Dubbing** - Generate audio from subtitle files\n",
        "\n",
        "**Select the branch to use:**\n",
        "- `main` - Stable version\n",
        "- `multispeaker` - Latest multi-speaker feature"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5LAp4JKRQJa4"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "#@title 📦 **Step 1: Install Kokoro TTS**\n",
        "#@markdown Select which branch to clone (use `multispeaker` for multi-speaker feature):\n",
        "branch = \"multispeaker\" #@param [\"multispeaker\", \"main\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "%cd /content/\n",
        "!rm -rf Kokoro-TTS-Subtitle\n",
        f\"!git clone -b {branch} https://github.com/Fujitoo/Kokoro-TTS-Subtitle.git\"\n",
        "%cd /content/Kokoro-TTS-Subtitle\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Installing dependencies...\")\n",
        "!pip install -q -r requirements.txt\n",
        "!apt-get -qq -y install espeak-ng > /dev/null 2>&1\n",
        "!pip install -q unidic\n",
        "\n",
        "from IPython.display import clear_output\n",
        "clear_output()\n",
        "print(f\"✅ Installation complete! Branch: {branch}\")\n",
        "print(\"👉 Proceed to Step 2 to launch the interface\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "cellView": "form",
        "id": "ycpG878e-9Se"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "#@title 🚀 **Step 2: Launch Gradio Interface**\n",
        "#@markdown Choose which interface to launch:\n",
        "interface = \"beta.py\" #@param [\"beta.py\", \"multispeaker.py\", \"app.py\", \"srt_dub.py\"]\n",
        "#@markdown Enable sharing to access from your device:\n",
        "enable_share = True #@param {type:\"boolean\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "%cd /content/Kokoro-TTS-Subtitle\n",
        "\n",
        "share_flag = \"--share\" if enable_share else \"\"\n",
        f\"!python {interface} {share_flag}\"\n",
        "\n",
        "# Click the public URL in the output to access the interface"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "cellView": "form",
        "id": "RRAZp7f6_ywU"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "## 🎭 Multi-Speaker Studio Quick Start\n",
        "\n",
        "**After launching `multispeaker.py` or `beta.py`:**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Configure Speakers** (left panel):\n",
        "   ```\n",
        "   Speaker1:af_bella\n",
        "   Speaker2:bf_isabella\n",
        "   Speaker3:af_nicole\n",
        "   ```\n",
        "\n",
        "2. **Write Script** (right panel):\n",
        "   ```\n",
        "   Speaker1: Hello! Welcome to our demo.\n",
        "   Speaker2: This is amazing!\n",
        "   {pause: 0.5}\n",
        "   Speaker1: We can add custom pauses.\n",
        "   ```\n",
        "\n",
        "3. **Click Generate** and listen to your multi-speaker audio!\n",
        "\n",
        "**Advanced Features:**\n",
        "- Use `{pause: 1.5}` for custom pauses\n",
        "- Use `Speaker(voice_name): text` for inline voice override\n",
        "- Enable volume normalization for consistent levels\n",
        "\n",
        "📖 Full documentation: [MULTISPEAKER_README.md](https://github.com/Fujitoo/Kokoro-TTS-Subtitle/blob/multispeaker/MULTISPEAKER_README.md)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "MultiSpeakerGuide"
      }
    },
