        "## 📚 Available Interfaces\n",
        "\n",
        "| Interface | Description | Best For |\n",
        "|-----------|-------------|----------|\n",
        "| **beta.py** | Complete suite with all features | All-in-one access |\n",
        "| **multispeaker.py** | Dedicated multi-speaker studio | Dialogue creation |\n",
        "| **app.py** | Simple single-speaker TTS | Quick text-to-speech |\n",
        "| **srt_dub.py** | SRT subtitle dubbing | Video dubbing |\n",
        "\n",
        "## 🌍 Supported Languages\n",
        "- American English, British English\n",
        "- Hindi, Spanish, French, Italian\n",
        "- Brazilian Portuguese, Japanese, Mandarin Chinese\n",
        "\n",
        "## ⚠️ Troubleshooting\n",
        "\n",
        "**If you encounter errors:**\n",
        "1. Re-run Step 1 to reinstall dependencies\n",
        "2. For Japanese audio errors:\n",
        "   ```\n",
        "   !pip uninstall unidic -y\n",
        "   !pip install unidic\n",
        "   !python -m unidic download\n",
        "   ```\n",
        "3. Make sure you're using the `multispeaker` branch for multi-speaker features\n",
        "\n",
